  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9TYytCO.png\" width=\"488\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kc2YGgk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/554379889122213888.svg?label=Join us on Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Additions 是 Mekanism 的官方附加模組，為遊戲增添了更多雜項功能。這些功能的大部分在 1.12 及更早版本的主模組中就已存在，但後來都遷移至此模組。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">功能：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">幼年生物：</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 苦力怕</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 末影人</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 骷髏</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 流浪者</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">&nbsp; - 凋靈骷髏</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">黑曜石 TNT</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">發光面板</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">氣球</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400\">各種形狀的塑膠方塊變體</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">語音伺服器</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400\">其他 Mekanism 模組連結：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-generators\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Generators</span></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:400\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism-tools\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-weight:400\">Mekanism Tools</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>文件說明</strong>&nbsp;可於 Mekanism 的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwiki.aidancbrady.com%252fwiki%252fMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方維基</a> 查閱，該維基由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fwww.indiewikis.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">IndieWikis</a> 自豪地承載！目前仍在持續更新中，如果您有能力，請務必協助貢獻內容！</p>\n<p><strong>原始碼&nbsp;</strong>已開放於 <strong><a href=\"https://github.com/mekanism-mod/Mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></strong>！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持團隊&nbsp;</strong>請透過 Patreon：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=260704\" rel=\"nofollow\">aidancbrady</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/pupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>支持團隊&nbsp;</strong>請透過 Ko-fi：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpupnewfster\" rel=\"nofollow\">pupnewfster</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
